      "shareMode": "customScheduled",
      "status": "sent",
      "text": "The technology moves fast enough that staying hands on with it isn't optional, it's the actual job.\nJust finished the Edge AI for Microcontrollers Specialization, working through real inference constraints on hardware with none of the headroom a full GPU gives you. That's a genuinely different discipline than cloud scale AI work, and it's exactly the kind of constraint clients are dealing with right now when edge deployment enters the conversation.\nThis one connects to real prior experience too, years spent on 0 to 1 hardware and AI products where edge compute, sensor data, and perception all had to converge into one working system, with real vendors and real dependencies, not a slide deck. That background is part of what Straventis brings into a client conversation, not theory, direct experience with where these systems actually get hard.\nStaying current on the technical side is part of how we stay useful to the people we work with.\n#EdgeAI #EmbeddedSystems #TechnicalAdvisory #Straventis",
